            <description sparkle:format="plain-text"><![CDATA[New: Ishara runs your shortcuts from any app. Hold Caps Lock and press a key, tap a key like Shift alone, or swipe three fingers on the trackpad.
A shortcut opens an app, presses keys in the app in front, or moves the window in front.
It hears a key only while Caps Lock is held, never your typing, and nothing leaves the Mac.
]]></description>
